  "releaseNotes": "10.6.6 - Fixes/polish: MFE-compatibility CSS (.edit-sr-only clip pattern, edit-masked-value wrapper class, tokenized --edit-tooltip-z-index); EditDatePicker/EditDateRange accessible-name, keyboard, focus-restore, and Gregorian-calendar fixes; invalid-state border for both pickers plus EditDateRange read-only class forwarding and default(DateTime) NullOrDefault hiding; Tabs strip updates same-pass for Count/Title/Disabled changes and drops Home/End; SearchInput addon-labelled input; pill Select invalid state now outranks pill chrome. See the README changelog for details.",
